{#- Home page ke search ke liye har notes article ki ek row (owner, 2026-11-26).
    assets/home.js me 26 rows haath se likhi hain; wo jaisi hain waisi rahengi (unke apne
    naam hain, jaise "Old English Literature — full notes"). Ye file unke alawa ke saare
    articles deti hai, aur home.js wahi rows jodta hai jinka pata pehle se list me nahi hai.
    Isliye /admin/upload-article/ se publish hua naya article site ke search me apne aap
    aa jata hai — koi row haath se nahi likhni padti. -#}
{% set rows = [] -%}
{%- for note in notesIndex -%}
{%- set rows = (rows.push({ t: note.title or note.crumbLabel or note.slug, u: note.url }), rows) -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{{ rows | dump | safe }}
